      "title": "",
      "instruction": "Supplemental I - Homogenization Buffer"
    },
    {
      "title": "",
      "instruction": "Start by adding distilled demineralized water (ddH20) corresponding to 1/3 of the final volume. Then add the different reagents, store the buffer on ice and adjust pH to 7.5."
    },
    {
      "title": "",
      "instruction": "PMSF is dissolved in Isopropanol while all other reagents are dissolved in ddH2O.\n# indicates that PMSF is dissolved in isopropanol * indicates that stock solution is stored at -30 °C. All other reagents were stored at +4 °C.\nΔ indicates that 4.65 mg Benzamidine is added to every 10 ml Buffer."
    },
